        "description": "22 PIECE SET: Includes 8\u201d and 9.5\u201d frying pans; 11\u201d frying pan with lid; 11\u201d grill pan with lid; 11\u201d chef\u2019s pan with lid; 11\u201d square griddle pan; 1.5qt and 3.25qt saucepans with lids; 3.25qt saut\u00e9 pan with lid; 5.4qt and 7.8qt stock pots with lids; small, medium, and large pan protectors. ATK AWARD-WINNING DESIGN: Valencia Pro recognized by America's Test Kitchen and Good Housekeeping for exceptional performance and sustainability. HEALTHY CERAMIC NONSTICK: GreenPan\u2019s toxin-free ceramic coating is completely PFAS-free for effortless food release and safer cooking. DIAMOND-REINFORCED TOUGHNESS: Diamond-infused surface adds extreme durability, excellent scratch resistance, and pro-level performance. HARD ANODIZED DURABILITY: Built for lasting strength and scratch resistance, delivering even heat and reliable performance meal after meal. VERSATILE COOKING PERFORMANCE: Safe for all stovetops, including induction, and oven safe up to 600\u00b0F (lids up to 425\u00b0F). DISHWASHER SAFE CLEANUP: Designed for easy cleaning\u2014dishwasher safe so you can spend more time enjoying your meals. METAL UTENSIL SAFE: Ultra-tough ceramic coating stands up to metal utensils without compromising nonstick performance. ERGONOMIC STAINLESS STEEL HANDLES: Mirror-polished stainless steel handles riveted for strength and shaped for a secure, comfortable grip while cooking. TEMPERED GLASS LIDS: Locks in moisture and flavor while giving you a clear view of your cooking.",
